CHANGE 4685180 MERGED 2023-07-26 17:54:10.000000000 91972744ac3601e2f628c8b6d5c40a4f31dae3f6 
sys-libs/llvm-libunwind: Remove ChromeOS workaround

Now that cmake-multilib.eclass has been updated (crrev/c/4622029), it
now defaults to using cmake.eclass instead of cmake-utils.eclass. As a
result, we can remove this workaround.

BUG=none
TEST=CQ passes

Change-Id: If4bc90365a5ea793ba1bbcc51220b62cac1537a6
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay/+/4685180
